{"unit_id": "tag:009B:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space），<MATH_0002>为一个点（point），<MATH_0003>为一个集合（set）。对于任意点（point）<MATH_0004>，位于<MATH_0005>且取值为（with value）<MATH_0006>的摩天楼层（skyscraper sheaf）在<MATH_0007>处的茎（stalk）为\n<MATHSEG_0001>若<MATHSEG_0002>若<MATHSEG_0003>\n阿贝尔群（abelian groups）、代数结构（algebraic structures）和模（modules）层（sheaves）的情形也有类似的描述。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "with value", "target_term": "取值为"}, {"source_term": "skyscraper sheaf", "target_term": "摩天楼层"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "引理所用的底空间"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "作为给定数据的点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "摩天楼层所取的集合"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "茎的描述所遍历的任意点"}, {"source_term": "with value", "target_term": "取值为", "context": "指定摩天楼层的取值"}, {"source_term": "skyscraper sheaf", "target_term": "摩天楼层", "context": "其茎由分情形公式描述的层"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "分情形公式描述的层的局部对象"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "类似描述所适用的一种对象"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "类似描述所适用的一种对象"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "最后一种情形中层所取的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "类似描述所适用的模层"}], "notes": []}
