{"unit_id": "tag:009E:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。\n设<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>为一个图表（diagram）。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0004>与<MATH_0005>都存在。\n<STRUCT_0004>包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0006>与极限（limits）交换（commutes）。换言之，层（sheaves）范畴（category）中的极限（limit）可以作为预层（presheaves）范畴（category）中的极限（limit）来计算。特别地，对任意开集（open）<MATH_0007>，有\n<MATH_0008>\n<STRUCT_0005>包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0009>一般不与余极限（colimits）交换（commute），即便是有限（finite）余极限（colimits）也是如此（试想满射（surjections））。这个余极限（colimit）可以由预层（presheaves）范畴（category）中的余极限（colimit）经层化（sheafification）得到：\n<MATH_0010>\n<STRUCT_0006>设<MATH_0011>为一个点（point）。一般而言，<MATH_0012>在<MATH_0013>处的茎（stalk）不等于各茎（stalks）的极限（limit），但当指标范畴（index category）为有限（finite）时，二者相等。换言之，茎（stalk）函子（functor）是左正合（left exact）的。\n<STRUCT_0007>设<MATH_0014>。总有\n<MATH_0015>\n<STRUCT_0008>层化（sheafification）函子（functor）<MATH_0016>与所有余极限（colimits）以及有限极限（finite limits）交换（commutes），但并非与所有极限（limits）都交换（commute）。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n这些证明都很容易。下面举一例，说明层（sheaves）的有向（directed）余极限（colimits）的一种性质。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "limit", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "limit", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "surject