{"unit_id": "tag:009F:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为有向集（directed set）。\n设<MATH_0003>是以<MATH_0004>为指标的集合（sets）层（sheaves）系（system），见范畴（Categories）一章第<REF_0001>节。\n设<MATH_0005>为开子集（open subset）。考虑典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0006>\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若所有转移映射（transition maps）都是单射（injective），则<MATH_0007>对任意开集（open）<MATH_0008>都是单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0003>若<MATH_0009>拟紧（quasi-compact），则<MATH_0010>是单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>若<MATH_0011>拟紧（quasi-compact），且所有转移映射（transition maps）都是单射（injective），则<MATH_0012>是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0005>若<MATH_0013>有一个共尾（cofinal）的开（open）覆盖（coverings）系（system）<MATH_0014>，其中<MATH_0015>有限（finite），且<MATH_0016>拟紧（quasi-compact）（对所有<MATH_0017>均成立），则<MATH_0018>是双射（bijective）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "directed set", "target_term": "有向集"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "转移映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "转移映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "cofinal", "target_term": "共尾"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系"}, {"source_term": "finite", "targ